<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一件男士休闲衬衫。<br />
<span style="color: #bb0000">A.展开更多</span> <span style="color: #bb0000">B.展开更多</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.展开更多</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目具有认知危害和信息危害，人类将项目穿上、认知项目以及描述项目的行为均会使自身受到精神影响，具体表现为在需要做出有3个以上选项的抉择时，将会明显地倾向于选择第3个选项。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被Dr.Coldmist于██服饰店以£9.15的价格购得。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容柜。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00374" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00374-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608129095" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598068525 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Aug 2020 03:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00116/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只日式漆器食盒，表面刻有樱花图样，在项目底部发现刻有古日语<em>晴明寮</em>的注文字样，内有 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">12</span> 9枚樱花饼。项目的异常性质具有精神影响，且只有在开启项目，并食用盒中樱花饼后才能激活。<br />
当项目异常性质激活时，受试者将会认为自己坐在一棵日本晚樱树（Oriental Cherry）下欣赏樱花，异常影响将会在受试者吃完手中樱饼后停止；额外放入项目中的樱花饼在食用时不会触发上述现象。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020<em>██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>中国香港特别行政区，Sothebuy's拍卖场，由Dr.Okazaki买下<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于site-cn-██低价值保险柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong> 此间遍开者,樱花烂漫胜仙境,不似人间景。</em> ——受到异常影响，盘坐于site-cn-██员工休息室地板上的Dr.Okazaki<br />
<em>Dr……Dr.Okazaki？</em>——Dr.Yang</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00116" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00116" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00116-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ps-yumemi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5005512); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5005512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608129095" alt="Ps Yumemi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5005512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ps-yumemi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5005512); return false;">Ps Yumemi</a></span></p>
